WEBVTT

00:09:28.105 --> 00:09:30.691
and bound around the house
like superheroes.

00:09:31.233 --> 00:09:35.571
But as we grew up, that type of play
wasn't encouraged anymore.

00:09:35.613 --> 00:09:38.574
And just as with any skill
that we don't use,

00:09:38.574 --> 00:09:40.034
we risk losing it.

00:09:41.535 --> 00:09:45.080
A couple months ago, my colleague and I,

00:09:45.122 --> 00:09:48.542
we were leading a workshop
for parents and teachers.

00:09:48.876 --> 00:09:51.754
And we brought materials
like shaving cream

00:09:51.795 --> 00:09:55.174
and plastic straws and buttons

00:09:55.215 --> 00:09:56.592
and pipe cleaners

00:09:56.592 --> 00:09:59.470
and just asked the parents
and teachers to play,

00:09:59.511 --> 00:10:00.804
to create.